# Evaluation corpus media and filled annotations. The recordings are licensed
# for evaluation and not for redistribution, and an annotation names spans in
# them; neither belongs in a public repository. `fetch-corpus` refuses to write
# anywhere Git would pick it up, and this is what makes the default safe.
/eval/corpus/media/
/eval/corpus/annotations/
/eval/corpus/*.signed.json
